<title>USA: Packard Bell NEC cuts prices on notebook lines.</title>
<headline>Packard Bell NEC cuts prices on notebook lines.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packard Bell NEC Inc said Wednesday it would cut prices by up to 17 percent on its value and power lines of Versa notebook computers.</p>
<p>The price reductions help push price points on notebooks with Intel Corp's MMX technology to under $2,500, the company said.</p>
<p>NEC Computer is a division of Packard Bell NEC Inc.</p>
